    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FAST, FREQUENT SERVICE\nBEST CORSI\nEXPANDING IN THE PACIFIC WEST\nWASHINGTON, OREGON AND IDAHO\nAND NOW CALIFORNIA!\nWEST COAST AIRLINES\nYour new key to the Golden Gate!\nEFFECTIVE JULY 31, 1959",
      "PORT\nANGELES\nSEATTLE\nWASHINGTON\nOMAK\nO\nSPOKANE\nABERDEEN,\nHOQUIAM\nASTORIA\n(SEASIDE)\nNEWPORT O\nTOLEDO\nNORTH BEND O\nCOOS BAY\nWENATCHEE\n• COEUR d'ALENE\nOLYMPIA O\n•\nEPHRATA\nMOSES LAKE\nYAKIMA\nPULLMAN\n• moscOw\nWALLA\nWALLA\nPORTLAND\nVANCOUVER\nPASCO\nRICHLAND O\nKENNEWICK\n-PENDLETON O\nO LEWISTON\nCLARKSTON\nLA GRANDE O\nOSALEM\nBAKER O\n•ALBANY\nCORVALLIS\nEUGENE\nOREGON\nONTARIO O\nPAYETTE\nBEND\nO REDMOND\nROSEBURG\nBURNS\nMEDFORD O\nKLAMATH\nFALLS\nO LAKEVIEW\nKALISPELL\nCUT BANK\nSHELBY\nGREAT FALLS\nMONTANA\nCALIFORNIA\nШСА\nSACRAMENTO\nOAKLAND\nSAN FRANCISCO\nO MCCALL (SEASONAL)\nIDAHO\nSUN VALLEY\nO HAILEY\nKETCHUM\nOIDAHO FALLS\nBOISE\n• POCATELLO\nTWIN FALLS O\nO\nBURLEY\nRUPERT\n• LOGAN\nO OGDEN\n•SALT LAKE CITY\nUTAH\nNOTE: Service to Salt Lake City, Logan and Ogden to\nstart September 1, 1959.\nService to Omak, Lakeview, Burns, Sun Valley-Hailey-\nKetchum to be inaugurated as soon as facilities are\navailable.\nService to Kalispell, Cut Bank-Shelby, Great Falls tenta-\ntively approved by Civil Aeronautics Board and now\nawaiting final decision."
